<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="558377083"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1788228175"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="一番の宝物"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Lia"/><amll:meta key="album" value="REVIVES -Lia Sings beautiful anime songs-"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:58.466"><div begin="00:00.000" end="05:58.466"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:05.650" itunes:key="L1">一番の宝物 - Lia (りあ)</p><p begin="00:05.650" end="00:11.300" itunes:key="L2">词：麻枝准<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">xi ： ma eda jiyun</span></p><p begin="00:11.300" end="00:16.950" itunes:key="L3">曲：麻枝准<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kiyoku ： ma eda jiyun</span></p><p begin="00:16.950" end="00:21.030" itunes:key="L4">裾が濡れたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假如下摆湿掉了的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">suso ga nu re ta na la</span></p><p begin="00:21.030" end="00:25.010" itunes:key="L5">乾くの待てばいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待着它风干就行了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kawa ku no ma te ba i i</span></p><p begin="00:25.010" end="00:31.870" itunes:key="L6">水音をたてて跳ねた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">水滴飞溅发出声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mizu oto wo ta te te ha ne ta</span></p><p begin="00:31.870" end="00:36.800" itunes:key="L7">きみが教えてくれたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是你教会了我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga oxi e te ku re ta n da</span></p><p begin="00:36.800" end="00:39.900" itunes:key="L8">もう恐くない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我不再害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u kowa ku na i</span></p><p begin="00:39.900" end="00:43.930" itunes:key="L9">握っていてくれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直紧握着我的手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nigi te i te ku re ta</span></p><p begin="00:43.930" end="00:55.840" itunes:key="L10">この手を離さなきゃだめだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可现在必须要放开了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no te wo hana sa na ki ya da me da</span></p><p begin="00:55.840" end="00:59.900" itunes:key="L11">ひとりでもゆくよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤身一人也要前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to li de mo yu ku yo</span></p><p begin="00:59.900" end="01:03.800" itunes:key="L12">例え辛くても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算艰苦不已也要前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tato e cula ku te mo</span></p><p begin="01:03.800" end="01:07.670" itunes:key="L13">みんなで見た夢は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随身携带的行李</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na de mi ta yume wa</span></p><p begin="01:07.670" end="01:11.810" itunes:key="L14">必ず持ってくよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是我们共同梦过的那场梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kanala zu mo te ku yo</span></p><p begin="01:11.810" end="01:15.760" itunes:key="L15">みんなとがいいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多希望和大家在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na to ga i i na</span></p><p begin="01:15.760" end="01:19.970" itunes:key="L16">みんなとがよかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多庆幸和大家在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na to ga yo ka ta</span></p><p begin="01:19.970" end="01:23.720" itunes:key="L17">でも目覚めた朝<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而清晨醒来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo me za me ta asa</span></p><p begin="01:23.720" end="01:44.910" itunes:key="L18">誰も居ないんだね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却只剩我一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">dare mo i na i n da ne</span></p><p begin="01:44.910" end="01:48.840" itunes:key="L19">もう振り返っても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使回头望去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u fu li kae te mo</span></p><p begin="01:48.840" end="01:52.880" itunes:key="L20">誰の影もない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也没有大家的踪影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">dare no kage mo na i</span></p><p begin="01:52.880" end="01:59.970" itunes:key="L21">水たまりだけが光った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有眼前的积水反射着光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mizu ta ma li da ke ga hika ta</span></p><p begin="01:59.970" end="02:01.780" itunes:key="L22">生きてくこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">活下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te ku ko to</span></p><p begin="02:01.780" end="02:07.720" itunes:key="L23">それは立ち向かっていくこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是要面对人生的种种</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re wa ta qi mu ka te i ku ko to</span></p><p begin="02:07.720" end="02:11.810" itunes:key="L24">それがわかったなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悟到这道理后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re ga wa ka ta na la</span></p><p begin="02:11.810" end="02:24.080" itunes:key="L25">後は踏み出す勇気だけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就只需要迈步向前的勇气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ato wa fu mi da su yuu ki da ke</span></p><p begin="02:24.080" end="02:27.880" itunes:key="L26">どこまでもゆくよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论要去何方我都会前进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo yu ku yo</span></p><p begin="02:27.880" end="02:31.740" itunes:key="L27">ここで知ったこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在此我学到的事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko de xi ta ko to</span></p><p begin="02:31.740" end="02:35.920" itunes:key="L28">幸せという夢を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能让我实现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">xi a wa se to i wu yume wo</span></p><p begin="02:35.920" end="02:39.890" itunes:key="L29">叶えてみせるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那名为幸福的梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kana e te mi se lu yo</span></p><p begin="02:39.890" end="02:43.690" itunes:key="L30">みんなと離れても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使与大家分离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na to hana re te mo</span></p><p begin="02:43.690" end="02:47.770" itunes:key="L31">どんなに遠くなっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使相隔天涯海角</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na ni too ku na te mo</span></p><p begin="02:47.770" end="02:51.610" itunes:key="L32">新しい朝に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也会继续前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">atala xi i asa ni</span></p><p begin="02:51.610" end="03:27.970" itunes:key="L33">この僕は生きるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迎接崭新的清晨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no boku wa i ki lu yo</span></p><p begin="03:27.970" end="03:31.850" itunes:key="L34">ひとりでもゆくよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤身一人也要前进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to li de mo yu ku yo</span></p><p begin="03:31.850" end="03:35.790" itunes:key="L35">死にたくなっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在绝望欲死的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">xi ni ta ku na te mo</span></p><p begin="03:35.790" end="03:39.660" itunes:key="L36">声が聞こえるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耳畔的声音会告诉我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">koe ga ki ko e lu yo</span></p><p begin="03:39.660" end="03:43.870" itunes:key="L37">死んではいけないと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要放弃生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">xi n de wa i ke na i to</span></p><p begin="03:43.870" end="03:47.710" itunes:key="L38">例え辛くても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算艰苦不已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tato e cula ku te mo</span></p><p begin="03:47.710" end="03:51.970" itunes:key="L39">闇に閉ざされても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算被黑暗所笼罩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yami ni to za sa re te mo</span></p><p begin="03:51.970" end="03:55.650" itunes:key="L40">心の奥には<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心灵深处的点点微光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kokolo no oku ni wa</span></p><p begin="03:55.650" end="03:59.840" itunes:key="L41">明かりが灯ってるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从来未曾间断</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ka li ga tomo te lu yo</span></p><p begin="03:59.840" end="04:03.700" itunes:key="L42">巡って流れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">岁月流转不息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">megu te naga re te</span></p><p begin="04:03.700" end="04:07.790" itunes:key="L43">時は移ろいだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫漫时间长河</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">toki wa wucu lo i da</span></p><p begin="04:07.790" end="04:11.670" itunes:key="L44">もう何があったか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以前发生过的事情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u nani ga a ta ka</span></p><p begin="04:11.670" end="04:15.840" itunes:key="L45">思い出せないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经回忆不起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">omo i da se na i ke do</span></p><p begin="04:15.840" end="04:19.770" itunes:key="L46">目を閉じてみれば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但只要闭上双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me wo to ji te mi re ba</span></p><p begin="04:19.770" end="04:23.890" itunes:key="L47">みんなの笑い声<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就会听到大家的笑声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na no wala i goe</span></p><p begin="04:23.890" end="04:27.670" itunes:key="L48">なぜかそれが今<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知为何这是如今</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ze ka so re ga ima</span></p><p begin="04:27.670" end="05:58.466" itunes:key="L49">一番の宝物<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我最珍贵的宝物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">iqi ban no takala mono</span></p></div></body></tt>